IBM AMLworld HI-Small transaction history embedded in this scorer

Source: IBM Transactions for Anti Money Laundering (AML), HI-Small
Provider: IBM, Erik Altman et al.
https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/ealtman2019/ibm-transactions-for-anti-money-laundering-aml

Changes: Q-FraudGuard selected transactions for the scorer's feature history,
normalized the data, assigned transaction IDs and combined bank and account IDs.
The scorer also stores confirmed-account timestamps based on AMLworld labels.

License of the embedded history: CDLA-Sharing-1.0
